Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|osgi.app.includes|social-private-messaging|
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|plugins.deployment.type|osgi|
		|testray.main.component.name|Private Messaging|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given User first Login PG

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given Page tear Down PG

Scenario: Private Messaging Smoke
Priority: 4
	Given UserBar goto Dashboard
	When Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Private Messaging|